  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PProject was born out of lessons &amp; a harrowing tale of sudden death 115 informal waste pickers due massive landslide at the Koshe dumpstite of which main victims were women caring children &amp;based upon first hand personal story we heard from a single mother of five children beneficiaries of MHO&apos;s free community-based childcare, who lives in a rented house &amp;unable to provide food &amp;care for all of them and given up two of her children for adoption before she has joined the MHO fee Childcare service</narrative>
